          {
            "slot": "s244",
            "repere": "Paragraphe · The main fear is feeling suffocated. H…",
            "text": "The main fear is feeling suffocated. Hostage Tape uses AirFlow™ mesh so air can pass through. It encourages nose breathing, not restriction. If your nose is fully blocked, just remove it. Not for severe nasal obstruction.",
            "image": "",
            "link": ""
          },
          {
