            "slot": "s254",
            "repere": "Paragraphe · In a 3-week clinical study by Dr. Dan …",
            "text": "In a 3-week clinical study by Dr. Dan Gartenberg, participants reported improved sleep, sleep that felt deeper, and less snoring, dry mouth and mouth breathing. The main findings showed a 78.9% drop in snoring. They also reported improved sleep quality by 84%.",
