            "slot": "s498",
            "repere": "Paragraphe · Yes. Hostage Tape uses BeardFlex™ tech…",
            "text": "Yes. Hostage Tape uses BeardFlex™ technology, a soft, flexible fabric designed to fit over stubble and facial hair and move with your mouth. Apply to clean, dry skin and peel off slowly in the morning.",
            "image": "",
            "link": ""
