            "slot": "s502",
            "repere": "Paragraphe · Yes. Hostage Tape is engineered with A…",
            "text": "Yes. Hostage Tape is engineered with AirFlow™ technology, a breathable mesh that lets air through so you never feel trapped or restricted. It encourages nasal breathing, not restricted breathing. You can breathe fully through your nose at all times. If your nose is fully blocked, simply remove the tape. It is not suitable for use if you have a severe nasal obstruction.",
            "image": "",
            "link": ""
