            "repere": "Paragraphe · Most people notice a difference within…",
            "text": "Most people notice a difference within the first few nights. Waking up feeling more rested, less dry-mouthed, and with more energy in the morning are the most commonly reported early changes. The real transformation happens over 90 nights. That's why our Starter Pack includes a full 90-night supply, so you can experience the full difference and build the habit that sticks. Individual results vary.",
            "image": "",
            "link": ""
